            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ tin ci Mikaa kɛ la̱t, kɛ bo̱o̱th palädɛ naŋ. Kä cu ji̱ Daan ben kä Lɛ̈-yic, kä nɛy ti pa̱lkɛ rɔ piny kä thilɛ mi diɛw kɛ, kä cukɛ kɛ näk, kä cukɛ wec waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ thil lua̱a̱k kɛ ɣöö na̱nɛ kɛ wec Dhi-don, kä thilɛ kɛ maar kɛ ram mi dɔ̱diɛn. Ɛn wec tëë lo̱o̱lä mi thieek kɛ Beth-re-ɣob. Kä cu ji̱ Daan wec nyɔk kɛ ta̱th, kä cukɛ cu cieŋ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ cɔl i̱ Daan kɛ ciöt gua̱ndɔɔŋdiɛn ni Daan, mëë la gat Je-kɔb. Wec ɛmɔ kɛ nhiam cɔalɛ Lɛ̈-yic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Daan kuth tin ca la̱t kɛ jiɛn cuɔ̱ŋ rɔ. Kä cu Jo-na-than gat Ger-com gat Muthɛ, kɛnɛ gaatkɛ a bööth palä kä ji̱ Daan amäni mëë pɛ̈ckɛ naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ kuth Mikaa jak kä tëë wi̱ni kɛ gua̱a̱th ëë te luaak Kuɔth kä Cilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.31"
            ]
          }
        }
